    2. Fill from extending sources (sources above barrier)
    3. Mark 3-barrier cells to always restore
    4. After fill, restore barrier cells to 3
    5. Result: fill applies, surface cells stay, barriers enforced
    """
    h, w = len(grid), len(grid[0])

